  "description": "CR 717.2a: Hunter's Talent's level 2 attack trigger and level 3 end-step trigger are absent until it reaches each level. At level 2 (CR 508.3a / 603.2), whenever alice attacks, target attacking creature gets +1/+0 and trample until end of turn (CR 611.2a, 514.2); at level 3, at the beginning of her end step, she draws only if she controls a creature with power 4 or greater (CR 603.4).",
  "note": "Turn 1 at level 1: no attack trigger and no trample. Turn 3 at level 2: the pump picks one attacker (bob's Serra Angel, not attacking, is refused), lasts to the end step, and is gone on bob's turn; with the 4/5 Earth Elemental and the pumped 4/3 Giant alice draws nothing, so level 3 is off. Turn 5 at level 3 she draws at her end step but not at bob's on turn 6. Turn 7, after bob murders the Elemental, her biggest is the 3/2 Bears, and bob's 4/4 Angel does not count.",
